<title>UK: BICBANCO sets $75 mln eight-year bond, +390 bp.</title>
<headline>BICBANCO sets $75 mln eight-year bond, +390 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ANZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO INDUSTRIAL E COMMERCIAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY	JULY.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+390 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
</text>
